      1						.TITLE UJFP11
      2						.IDENT /00.06/
      3					; CP73 FP11-A firmware: F/D add/subtract, seven guard bits. Absolute HALT FRAM, CP67 module ABI3.
      4					; LDFPS/STFPS/STST support all eight word addressing modes.
      5					; F/D CLR/TST/ABS/NEG/CMP/ADD/SUB; multiply/divide/conversion remain absent.
